      "headline": "Panduan Lengkap Magang Mahasiswa Informatika di Malang Jalur Web Engineering Skill",
      "description": "Panduan magang mahasiswa informatika Malang: tugas nyata, skill, tools, output portofolio, dan alur daftar. Baca sekarang dan siapkan langkah pertamamu.",
      "inLanguage": "id-ID",
      "mainEntityOfPage": "https://infomagangmalang.web.id/blog/magang-mahasiswa-informatika-malang1",
      "image": "https://infomagangmalang.web.id/assets/img/magang-mahasiswa-informatika-malang-1a.webp",
      "datePublished": "2026-11-23T05:00:00+07:00",
      "dateModified": "2026-11-23T05:00:00+07:00",
      "author": {
        "@type": "Person",
        "name": "Sholikhatun Nikmah"
      },
      "publisher": {
